<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Ector Cty Hospital, Texas.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Ector Cty Hospital, Texas.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwest Securities Inc said it received the written award for $24.030 million of Ector County Hospital District, Texas, hospital revenue refunding bonds, Series 1997, with a top yield of 5.30 percent in 2006.</p>
